"| `+UnsignedQuadruplewordElement+`, `+SignedQuadruplewordElement+`\n"
"| 4\n"
"| 64 Bit ganzzahlig\n"
"| `+FloatDoublewordElement+`, `+FloatQuadruplewordElement+`\n"
"| 2 / 4\n"
"| IEEE-754 float / double\n"
"| `+StringWordElement+`\n"
