"| Lücke, wird ignoriert\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
msgid ""
"The word order of multi-part values (`+WordOrder+`) can be set, e.g. "
"`+.wordOrder(WordOrder.LSWMSW)+`, if the device sends the least significant "
"word first."
msgstr ""
"Die Wortreihenfolge mehrteiliger Werte (`+WordOrder+`) ist einstellbar, z. "
"B. `+.wordOrder(WordOrder.LSWMSW)+`, falls das Gerät das niederwertige Wort "
"zuerst sendet."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
msgid "Mapping bits to State-Channels:"
msgstr "Bits auf State-Channels abbilden:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"m(new BitsWordElement(32, this)\n"
"        .bit(0, BatteryInverterSinexcel.ChannelId.FAULT_STATUS)\n"
"        .bit(1, BatteryInverterSinexcel.ChannelId.ALERT_STATUS)\n"
"        ...)\n"
msgstr ""
"m(new BitsWordElement(32, this)\n"
"        .bit(0, BatteryInverterSinexcel.ChannelId.FAULT_STATUS)\n"
"        .bit(1, BatteryInverterSinexcel.ChannelId.ALERT_STATUS)\n"
"        ...)\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conversion (converter)"
msgstr "Umrechnung (Converter)"

#. type: #sec-conversion-converter
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
msgid ""
"The third parameter of `+m(channel, element, converter)+` converts register "
"values to Channel values and back when writing "
"(`+ElementToChannelConverter+`)."
msgstr ""
"Der dritte Parameter von `+m(channel, element, converter)+` rechnet "
"Register- in Channel-Werte um und beim Schreiben zurück "
"(`+ElementToChannelConverter+`)."

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Converter\n"
"| Effect when reading\n"
"\n"
"| `+DIRECT_1_TO_1+` (default)\n"
"| unchanged\n"
"| `+SCALE_FACTOR_1+`, `+_2+`, `+_3+`\n"
"| × 10, × 100, × 1000 (e.g. kV → V or kW → W)\n"
"| `+SCALE_FACTOR_MINUS_1+`, `+_2+`, `+_3+`\n"
"| ÷ 10, ÷ 100, ÷ 1000\n"
"| `+INVERT+`, `+INVERT_IF_TRUE(bool)+`\n"
"| reverse the sign (always or depending on the Config)\n"
"| `+KEEP_POSITIVE+`, `+KEEP_NEGATIVE_AND_INVERT+`\n"
"| only let positive values through, or only negative values and invert them, otherwise 0; useful for distributing a signed power to two Channels\n"
"| `+SET_NULL_FOR_DEFAULT(value)+`\n"
"| adopt an “invalid” value of the device (e.g. 0xFFFF) as `+null+`\n"
"| `+chain(…)+`\n"
"| several converters in a row\n"
msgstr ""
"| Converter\n"
"| Wirkung beim Lesen\n"
"\n"
"| `+DIRECT_1_TO_1+` (Standard)\n"
"| unverändert\n"
"| `+SCALE_FACTOR_1+`, `+_2+`, `+_3+`\n"
"| × 10, × 100, × 1000 (z. B. kV → V oder kW → W)\n"
"| `+SCALE_FACTOR_MINUS_1+`, `+_2+`, `+_3+`\n"
"| ÷ 10, ÷ 100, ÷ 1000\n"
"| `+INVERT+`, `+INVERT_IF_TRUE(bool)+`\n"
"| Vorzeichen umkehren (immer bzw. abhängig von der Config)\n"
"| `+KEEP_POSITIVE+`, `+KEEP_NEGATIVE_AND_INVERT+`\n"
"| nur positive Werte durchlassen bzw. nur negative und dabei invertieren, sonst 0; nützlich, um eine vorzeichenbehaftete Leistung auf zwei Channels zu verteilen\n"
"| `+SET_NULL_FOR_DEFAULT(wert)+`\n"
"| einen „ungültig“-Wert des Geräts (z. B. 0xFFFF) als `+null+` übernehmen\n"
"| `+chain(…)+`\n"
"| mehrere Converter hintereinander\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
msgid ""
"The unit of the Channel is in its `+Doc+` (e.g. `+Unit.WATT+`). The "
"converter must lead from the device value to exactly this unit. Example: the "
"device provides voltage in V as float, Channel `+VOLTAGE_L1+` is in mV → "
"`+SCALE_FACTOR_3+`."
msgstr ""
"Die Einheit des Channels steht in seinem `+Doc+` (z. B. `+Unit.WATT+`). Der "
"Converter muss vom Gerätewert auf genau diese Einheit führen. Beispiel: "
"Gerät liefert Spannung in V als float, Channel `+VOLTAGE_L1+` ist in mV → "
"`+SCALE_FACTOR_3+`."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Writing"
msgstr "Schreiben"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"new FC6WriteRegisterTask(135,\n"
"        m(BatteryInverterSinexcel.ChannelId.SET_ACTIVE_POWER, new SignedWordElement(135), SCALE_FACTOR_2))\n"
msgstr ""
"new FC6WriteRegisterTask(135,\n"
"        m(BatteryInverterSinexcel.ChannelId.SET_ACTIVE_POWER, new SignedWordElement(135), SCALE_FACTOR_2))\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
msgid ""
"The Channel must be a write-channel (`+accessMode+` WRITE_ONLY or "
"READ_WRITE)."
msgstr ""
"Der Channel muss ein Write-Channel sein (`+accessMode+` WRITE_ONLY oder "
"READ_WRITE)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
msgid ""
"`+setNextWriteValue(v)+` on the Channel immediately passes the value to the "
"element (with conversion via the converter). The write task fetches it in "
"the next write step and **then resets it**."
msgstr ""
"`+setNextWriteValue(v)+` auf dem Channel gibt den Wert sofort an das Element "
"weiter (mit Umrechnung über den Converter). Der Schreib-Task holt ihn im "
"nächsten Schreibschritt ab und **setzt ihn danach zurück**."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
msgid ""
"Consequence: a value is written exactly once. If the device is to receive a "
"setpoint permanently (many inverters require this as a sign of life), the "
"driver must set it anew in every Cycle, typically in `+applyPower()+` or a "
"Cycle Event."
msgstr ""
"Folge: Ein Wert wird genau einmal geschrieben. Soll das Gerät einen Sollwert "
"dauerhaft erhalten (viele Wechselrichter verlangen das als Lebenszeichen), "
"muss der Treiber ihn in jedem Zyklus neu setzen, typischerweise in "
"`+applyPower()+` oder einem Zyklus-Ereignis."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checking a driver"
msgstr "Treiber prüfen"

#. type: #sec-checking-a-driver
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
msgid ""
"With `+DummyModbusBridge+`, register contents can be specified in the test "
"and the Channel values checked; see xref:development/testing/component-"
"tests.adoc[Component tests]."
msgstr ""
"Mit `+DummyModbusBridge+` lassen sich Registerinhalte im Test vorgeben und "
"die Channel-Werte prüfen; siehe xref:development/testing/component-"
"tests.adoc[Tests]."

#. type: #sec-checking-a-driver
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
msgid ""
"On the real Bridge, the setting “Log-Verbosity” shows the Modbus requests in "
"the log."
msgstr ""
"An der echten Bridge zeigt die Einstellung „Log-Verbosity“ die Modbus-"
"Anfragen im Log."

#. type: #sec-checking-a-driver
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/modbus-device-drivers.adoc
msgid ""
"Via `+ModbusSlave+`/`+getModbusSlaveTable()+`, the driver also provides its "
"Channels in the Modbus/TCP API of the Edge."
msgstr ""
"Über `+ModbusSlave+`/`+getModbusSlaveTable()+` stellt der Treiber seine "
"Channels zusätzlich in der Modbus/TCP-API der Edge bereit."
